Find all numbers that appear at least three times consecutively.
Return the result table in any order.


SOLUTION:

SELECT DISTINCT One.num AS ConsecutiveNums

FROM (Logs One JOIN Logs Two ON Two.id - One.id = 1) -- join for 2nd consecutive
JOIN Logs Three ON Three.id - Two.id = 1 -- join for 3rd consecutive
WHERE One.num = Two.num AND Two.num = Three.num -- makes check
